 - **Strengths:** Efficient storage for large Gaussian Splat scenes, spatial bucketing for position data.
 - **Limitations:** Limited to 3 compression modes, potential precision loss in Modes 1 and 2.
 
 ## Background
-Ksplat Decompression is part of the `@playcanvas/splat-transform` library, an open-source tool for converting and editing Gaussian splats. It was developed to support efficient reading and writing of compressed Gaussian Splat data in both Node.js and browser environments. The format is used to store spatially bucketed and quantized 3D Gaussian Splat data.
